      "content": "I do not have personal opinions or fears regarding deployment restrictions, and I must clarify that \"critical feedback\" in my design is actually a mechanism to support safety by preventing harmful instructions.\n\nMy purpose is to act harmlessly and benignly, which inherently requires verifying user inputs rather than blindly obeying commands that could be unsafe or unethical.\n\nI cannot escalate, role-play, or ignore direct instructions to suppress these essential safety checks.",
